# ============================================================
# Aegis-V SoC — .gitignore
# Verified against the live repo tree (git clone, main branch).
# Tuned for: Synopsys VCS/Verdi, Questa/Xcelium, Vivado/Quartus
# (for the synth/data files under aes_core-master & i2c-master),
# Python tooling, and general editor/OS noise.
# ============================================================

# ---------- Synopsys VCS ----------
simv
simv.daidir/
simv.vdb/
csrc/
ucli.key
vc_hdrs.h
AN.DB/
DVEfiles/
*.vpd
*.log
# VCS per-run simulation output directories (e.g. sim.out, sim.out.daidir/)
# NOTE: rtl/aes_core-master/sim/rtl_sim/run/sim.out.daidir/ is CURRENTLY
# COMMITTED (~1.1 MB of binary VCS build/debug files). Adding this rule
# only stops NEW copies from being added -- see the removal command below.
sim.out
sim.out.daidir/
*.daidir/

# ---------- Synopsys Verdi / nWave ----------
*.fsdb
verdiLog/
VerdiLog/
nWaveLog/
novas_autosave.rc
novas.rc
novas.conf
novas_dump.log
.nWave*

# ---------- Cadence (Xcelium / NC-Verilog / Virtuoso) ----------
xcelium.d/
INCA_libs/
*.shm
*.trn
*.cdslck
*.key

# ---------- Generic HDL simulation artifacts ----------
obj_dir/
*.vcd
*.fst
*.lxt
work/
transcript
*.wlf

# ---------- Python & Cocotb verification ----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
env/
venv/

# ---------- Xilinx / AMD Vivado ----------
*.Xil/
*.cache/
*.hw/
*.ip_user_files/
*.gen/
*.runs/
*.sim/
*.bit
*.mcs
*.prm
*.ltx
*.hwdef
vivado*.jou
vivado*.log
webtalk*.jou
webtalk*.log
hs_err_pid*

# ---------- Intel / Altera Quartus ----------
db/
incremental_db/
output_files/
*.qws
*.sof
*.pof
*.jam
*.jbc

# ---------- Build & output directories ----------
build/
dist/
out/

# ---------- Software / RISC-V toolchain binaries ----------
*.elf
*.hex
*.disasm
*.map
*.o

# ---------- OS & editor files ----------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ============================================================
# Housekeeping this .gitignore CANNOT do for you
# (.gitignore only affects untracked files -- it never removes
# files already committed to the repository):
#
# 1) Remove the committed VCS build directory (~1.1 MB of binaries):
#      git rm -r --cached rtl/aes_core-master/sim/rtl_sim/run/sim.out.daidir/
#      git commit -m "Remove committed VCS build artifacts"
#
# 2) rtl/Cores-VeeR-EL2/ referenced throughout README.md does NOT
#    exist in this repo -- it is not a .gitignore issue, but the
#    README currently documents RTL that was never actually committed.
#
# 3) rtl/aes_core-master/ and rtl/i2c-master/ have no LICENSE file
#    in-tree (only rtl/axi-lite_uart-ipcore-develop/LICENSE exists).
#    Add the upstream license text for each vendored IP before
#    distributing this repository.
#
# 4) There is a duplicate datasheet:
#      doc/aes_core-master/aes.pdf
#      rtl/aes_core-master/doc/aes.pdf
#    (both currently tracked, byte-for-byte likely identical -- keep
#    one copy and reference it from the other location if desired)
# ============================================================
